{"seq":3,"slug":"economic-geography","title":"大学地理学 — 经济地理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/geography/human-geography/economic-geography","wordCount":2079,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学地理学-经济地理学\">大学地理学 — 经济地理学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>经济地理学研究经济活动的空间组织、区位选择和区域发展差异。为什么硅谷成为全球科技创新中心？为什么中国沿海地区远比内陆富裕？经济地理学通过区位理论、产业集聚、全球价值链和空间不平等等分析框架回答这些问题。从韦伯的工业区位论到克鲁格曼的新经济地理学，该学科不断融入经济学的理论工具，同时保持对&quot;空间&quot;这一核心变量的关注。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心理论</th>\n<th>提出者</th>\n<th>核心主张</th>\n<th>年代</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>农业区位论</td>\n<td>Von Thünen</td>\n<td>农业类型按距城市远近分圈层分布</td>\n<td>1826</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工业区位论</td>\n<td>Weber</td>\n<td>企业选址追求运输成本最小化</td>\n<td>1909</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中心地理论</td>\n<td>Christaller</td>\n<td>服务业按等级体系空间分布</td>\n<td>1933</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增长极理论</td>\n<td>Perroux</td>\n<td>经济增长从极点向周边扩散</td>\n<td>1955</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新经济地理学</td>\n<td>Krugman</td>\n<td>规模经济+运输成本→集聚</td>\n<td>1991</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全球价值链</td>\n<td>Gereffi</td>\n<td>生产环节在全球空间上的分工</td>\n<td>1994</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-von-th-nen-农业区位论\">一、Von Thünen 农业区位论</h3><p>Von Thünen（1826）假设一个孤立国，中心为单一城市，周围是均质的农业平原。农民选择种植何种作物取决于利润最大化，而利润受运输成本影响。地租函数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = (p - c) \\cdot Y - Y \\cdot t \\cdot d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 为地租，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为市场价格，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 为生产成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 为单位面积产量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为单位距离运输费率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为到市场的距离。</p>\n<p>不同作物因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 不同，形成不同斜率的地租曲线，交叉点决定了各圈层的边界：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;城市核心&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;第一圈: 鲜奶/蔬菜&lt;br/&gt;易腐、高运费&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;第二圈: 林业&lt;br/&gt;木材体积大&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;第三圈: 集约谷物&lt;br/&gt;轮作农业&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;第四圈: 粗放谷物&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;第五圈: 畜牧&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;荒地&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"城市核心\"] --&gt; B[\"第一圈: 鲜奶/蔬菜&lt;br/&gt;易腐、高运费\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"第二圈: 林业&lt;br/&gt;木材体积大\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"第三圈: 集约谷物&lt;br/&gt;轮作农业\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"第四圈: 粗放谷物\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"第五圈: 畜牧\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"荒地\"]</pre><p>现代应用中，冷链运输和全球化打破了 Von Thünen 的距离约束，但其&quot;运输成本塑造空间格局&quot;的核心逻辑仍然有效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-weber-工业区位论\">二、Weber 工业区位论</h3><p>Weber（1909）分析了单个工厂的最优区位选择，核心变量是运输成本和劳动成本。</p>\n<p><strong>原料指数</strong>（Material Index）决定了工厂偏向原料地还是市场：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>局地原料重量</mtext><mtext>成品重量</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MI = \\frac{\\text{局地原料重量}}{\\text{成品重量}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成品重量</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">局地原料重量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MI &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>：原料导向型（如钢铁、水泥）——工厂靠近原料产地</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MI &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>：市场导向型（如饮料、家具）——工厂靠近消费市场</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产业类型</th>\n<th>原料指数</th>\n<th>区位偏向</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>钢铁冶炼</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≫</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gg 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>原料地/港口</td>\n<td>宝钢（上海港）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>食品加工</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>市场或原料均可</td>\n<td>蒙牛（呼和浩特）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软饮料</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≪</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ll 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>市场</td>\n<td>可口可乐各地工厂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电子组装</td>\n<td>接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>劳动力/物流枢纽</td>\n<td>富士康（郑州）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Weber 还引入<strong>集聚因素</strong>（agglomeration factor）：当多个工厂共享基础设施和劳动力池时，集聚带来的成本节省可能超过偏离最优区位的损失。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-christaller-中心地理论\">三、Christaller 中心地理论</h3><p>（此部分与城市地理学有交叉，这里侧重经济含义。）</p>\n<p>Christaller 的六边形市场区模型建立在两个核心概念上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>门槛</strong>（threshold）: 企业维持经营所需的最小市场需求</li>\n<li><strong>服务范围</strong>（range）: 消费者愿意为获取该服务所能接受的最大出行距离</li>\n</ul>\n<p>高阶商品（如专科医院、大学）门槛高、范围大，只在大城市提供；低阶商品（如便利店、小学）门槛低、分布密集。这形成了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>（市场原则）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>（交通原则）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = 7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span>（行政原则）三种等级嵌套系统。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-产业集聚与产业区\">四、产业集聚与产业区</h3><p>Marshall（1890）首先观察到&quot;产业区&quot;（industrial district）现象：同类企业在空间上集中能获得三大外部性：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>专业化劳动力池</strong>——工人技能与产业需求匹配</li>\n<li><strong>中间投入品供应</strong>——供应商网络降低交易成本</li>\n<li><strong>知识溢出</strong>——面对面交流加速创新扩散</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[&quot;产业集聚&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;劳动力池&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;供应商网络&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;知识溢出&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;企业生产率提升&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;更多企业进入&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; A\">graph TB\n    A[\"产业集聚\"] --&gt; B[\"劳动力池\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"供应商网络\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"知识溢出\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"企业生产率提升\"]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"更多企业进入\"]\n    F --&gt; A</pre><p>这一正反馈循环解释了硅谷（信息技术）、好莱坞（影视）、温州（低压电器）等产业集聚的自我强化机制。Porter 的钻石模型进一步将竞争优势归因于要素条件、需求条件、相关产业和企业战略四个维度。</p>\n<p>Krugman（1991）的新经济地理学将集聚纳入一般均衡框架：规模报酬递增 + 运输成本的相互作用决定了经济活动是分散还是集中。核心-边缘模型（core-periphery model）显示，当运输成本低于临界值时，制造业向核心区集中，形成空间不平等。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-全球价值链\">五、全球价值链</h3><p>Gereffi 的全球价值链（Global Value Chain, GVC）框架分析了产品从设计到销售各环节在全球空间上的分工。&quot;微笑曲线&quot;描述了价值分布：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价值链环节</th>\n<th>附加值</th>\n<th>主导区域</th>\n<th>代表活动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>研发设计</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>发达国家</td>\n<td>芯片架构设计（美国）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零部件制造</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>技术密集新兴国</td>\n<td>芯片代工（台湾地区）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组装加工</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>劳动力密集国家</td>\n<td>手机组装（中国、越南）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌营销</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>发达国家</td>\n<td>Apple品牌运营（美国）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>售后服务</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>消费市场所在地</td>\n<td>本地化服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中国在全球价值链中的位置正在发生结构性转变：从&quot;世界工厂&quot;（低端组装）向&quot;创新驱动&quot;（研发设计+品牌）攀升。华为、比亚迪等企业代表了这一升级方向。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-空间不平等与区域发展\">六、空间不平等与区域发展</h3><p>空间不平等是经济地理学的核心议题。Myrdal 的循环累积因果模型指出，初始优势地区通过回流效应（backwash effect）从落后地区吸走资本和劳动力，加剧不平等；但扩散效应（spread effect）也可能将增长传递到外围。</p>\n<p>衡量区域不平等的常用指标是变异系数和基尼系数。中国的东中西差距虽在缩小，但绝对差距仍然巨大——2023 年人均 GDP 最高省份（北京）约为最低省份（甘肃）的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 倍以上。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>σ</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CV = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\bar{x}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}(x_i - \\bar{x})^2 / n}}{\\bar{x}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.316em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.63em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6927em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9373em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8973em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3027em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为各区域人均 GDP，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为全国平均值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>用 Von Thünen 模型解释为什么大城市周边常形成&quot;蔬菜基地&quot;和&quot;奶源带&quot;。如果引入高速公路会如何改变圈层结构？</li>\n<li>分析一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>≫</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MI \\gg 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的产业（如铝冶炼，需大量电力），讨论为什么铝厂通常建在水电站附近而非消费市场。</li>\n<li>选择一个你了解的产业集聚案例（如中关村、义乌小商品、景德镇陶瓷），用 Marshall 外部性理论解释其形成机制。</li>\n<li>查找一部智能手机的价值链分解数据，分析各环节的地理分布和价值捕获比例。</li>\n<li>中国实施&quot;西部大开发&quot;和&quot;一带一路&quot;战略的经济地理学逻辑是什么？它们是否能有效缩小空间不平等？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Dicken, P. <em>Global Shift</em>（第八版）是全球经济地理学的标准参考书。</li>\n<li>李小建《经济地理学》是国内广泛使用的中文教材，理论与中国案例结合。</li>\n<li>Krugman, P. <em>Geography and Trade</em> 是新经济地理学的奠基之作，篇幅短小精悍。</li>\n<li>世界银行《世界发展报告 2009：重塑世界经济地理》全面讨论了空间不平等问题。</li>\n<li>UNCTAD 《世界投资报告》提供全球价值链和跨国投资的最新数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>经济地理学从区位理论出发，经由产业集聚和全球价值链分析，最终聚焦于空间不平等这一核心问题。Von Thünen 的地租模型、Weber 的运输成本分析和 Christaller 的中心地理论构成了经典区位理论的三大支柱。新经济地理学将规模经济和运输成本纳入统一框架，解释了集聚与分散的动态平衡。在全球化和数字经济时代，经济地理学的研究边界正在向创新地理、数字平台经济和绿色转型方向延伸。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学地理学 — 经济地理学","id":"大学地理学-经济地理学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、Von Thünen 农业区位论","id":"一-von-th-nen-农业区位论"},{"level":3,"text":"二、Weber 工业区位论","id":"二-weber-工业区位论"},{"level":3,"text":"三、Christaller 中心地理论","id":"三-christaller-中心地理论"},{"level":3,"text":"四、产业集聚与产业区","id":"四-产业集聚与产业区"},{"level":3,"text":"五、全球价值链","id":"五-全球价值链"},{"level":3,"text":"六、空间不平等与区域发展","id":"六-空间不平等与区域发展"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学地理学 — 城市地理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/geography/human-geography/urban-geography"},"next":{"title":"大学地理学 — GIS 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/geography/gis-remote-sensing/gis-fundamentals"}}